    "parsing_res_list": [
        {
            "block_label": "header",
            "block_content": "Vislons applying only to regulated superannuation funds Part 7",
            "block_bbox": [
                391,
                0,
                1031,
                30
            ],
            "block_id": 0,
            "block_order": null
        },
        {
            "block_label": "header",
            "block_content": "Section 68AA ",
            "block_bbox": [
                864,
                94,
                1030,
                119
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": null
        },
        {
            "block_label": "doc_title",
            "block_content": "68AA Benefits for permanent incapacity and death--MySuper  members \n",
            "block_bbox": [
                180,
                150,
                956,
                205
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 1
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Requirement to provide permanent incapacity benefit and death.benefit by taking out insurance \n",
            "block_bbox": [
                312,
                240,
                994,
                294
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 2
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(1) Each trustee of a regulated superannuation fund must ensure the following:",
            "block_bbox": [
                267,
                317,
                997,
                370
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 3
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(a) that the fund provides permanent incapacity benefit to each MySuper member of the fund;",
            "block_bbox": [
                326,
                380,
                1008,
                432
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 4
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(b) that the fund provides death benefit in respect of each.MySuper member of the fund;",
            "block_bbox": [
                323,
                440,
                949,
                492
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 5
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(c) that the benefits referred to in paragraphs (a) and (b) are provided by taking out insurance..\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                323,
                503,
                976,
                556
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 6
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Note:A failure to comply with subsection (1) is a breach of a condition of the RSE licence (see paragraph 29E(1)(a)).\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                302,
                572,
                1015,
                618
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 7
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(2) The trustees of a regulated superannuation fund are not required to provide permanent incapacity benefit or death benefit if the conditions determined under subsection (3) in relation to the benefit are not met.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                256,
                641,
                1028,
                752
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 8
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(3) The trustees of a regulated superannuation fund may determine.reasonable conditions to which the provision of:.",
            "block_bbox": [
                254,
                778,
                993,
                830
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 9
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(a) permanent incapacity benefit; or ",
            "block_bbox": [
                319,
                841,
                725,
                865
            ],
            "block_id": 11,
            "block_order": 10
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(b) death benefit;",
            "block_bbox": [
                318,
                873,
                521,
                896
            ],
            "block_id": 12,
            "block_order": 11
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "is subject.",
            "block_bbox": [
                301,
                907,
                415,
                931
            ],
            "block_id": 13,
            "block_order": 12
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(4) Without limiting subsection (3), conditions determined under subsection (3) in relation to a benefit are reasonable if they are the same as the terms and conditions of the policy of insurance taken.out to provide the benefit.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                256,
                954,
                1027,
                1065
            ],
            "block_id": 14,
            "block_order": 13
        },
        {
            "block_label": "footer",
            "block_content": "Superannuation Industry (Supervision) Act 1993",
            "block_bbox": [
                451,
